WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.320
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:32.080
"Extra: Acceptance Into Hair Cuticle Academy"

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.120
All right, everyone settle down.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.900
I'm going to introduce
the transfer student.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.060
It's written as "nonisaku ke,"
but pronounced, "Nosaki Kei-kun."

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:39.630
Nosaki Kei

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:39.740
It's Nozaki Kei, and it's
written this way!

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:40.550
Scribble

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.030
Nozaki Kei
It's Nozaki Kei, and it's
written this way!

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:43.790
Let's see, for your seat...

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:45.570
Is the seat next to you ope, Natsuki?

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:46.400
No.

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.830
Soumei-kun is still
occupying the seat.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.970
What? He's still there?

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:52.550
He's been there since the
school was established

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:54.730
thirty years ago and still won't pass on.
What a troublesome ghost.

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:56.550
You handle ghosts rather lightly here.

00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:59.860
Guess there's no other choice
but to put you next to Yuuta,

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:00.760
the boy wearing the girl's uniform.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:02.760
Squirm
the boy wearing the girl's uniform.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.930
A bit much for a new
student, isn't it?!
Squirm

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:07.640
Nice to meet you, Yuuta-kun.

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:09.890
I wonder if he's shy.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.860
Make sure you look after Kei, Yuuta.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:14.450
Make sure you lead him along.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:15.720
Yes, Sensei.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.240
You're not expecting me
to wear that, are you?

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.950
Baaa

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:22.150
That's a rather irritating
chime, isn't it?

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.160
Yeah.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:23.430
School
Issued

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:25.610
The bags issued by the
school are ugly, too.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:27.970
It's almost like they're
trying to bully us.

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:30.370
I wonder if they have something
against the students.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.590
At least the track suits
are somewhat decent.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.340
All right, time for gym!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.380
Keep your eye on the damn ball! Next!

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.370
She seems like a scary teacher.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.100
She's actually being
pretty nice today.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.170
Here comes the next one!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:50.230
Dodge it!

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.790
That was a bit dangerous.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:55.570
Are you all right?

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.990
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.240
No problem.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:01.420
See you later.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.760
He's amazing!

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.350
He caught that with so much ease!

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:07.410
Nothing less from a guy
who's usually an SP!

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:09.910
This is an extra story,
so don't say "usually"!

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.620
He's Mr. Ogata, the foreign languages teacher.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.040
He's good-looking, sporty,
and he's fluent in foreign languages?!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.410
Look at how long his legs are!
He's entirely too cool!

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:18.150
That's not fair!

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:18.880
You think so?

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:21.950
I can't say I ever thought
he looked cool.

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.050
Never mind.
His second language isn't human.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:24.690
Exhausted

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:25.760
That was some workout.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.740
That was too hard even for gym class.

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:32.310
Looks like Ms. Gabby
took a liking to you.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:34.690
I think I can do without
this favoritism...

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:37.730
That's it. Can't move anymore.

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.760
Are you planning on
becoming Soumei No. 2?

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.030
What's the matter?

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:44.320
Sorry. I can't move.

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:46.780
That's Mr. Ogino from social studies.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.520
What might you be doing?

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:51.710
Habit.

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:54.600
I'll take you to the nurse's office.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.160
Daddy's back is so broad.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.950
You should go back to class.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:03:59.960
Aww.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.420
Nurse's Office

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.130
He's all flimsy.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:05.270
Go rest on an open bed.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.100
Okay.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.950
The beds seem to be occupied
by a dried-out weakling and

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.270
someone who forgot to take off
their glasses before sleeping.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:15.200
The one with the glasses
is just a body pillow.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.170
Don't mind him.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.160
He's a human!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.640
I didn't think you'd actually hug him,

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:26.780
but he's pretty close to one, no?

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.160
Yes! No resistance at all!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.910
Baaa

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.870
Trudge Trudge

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.600
Everyone's so weird at this school.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.840
Well, at least they all seem to be nice.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:39.650
Are you all right?

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:40.710
Everyone is so warm here.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.970
Do you feel better now?

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:42.630
I'll like this school in no time.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.000
That's good.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:44.740
That's good. Feel better soon.

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:47.040
The problems here won't seem
so bad once I'm used to them.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:47.390
Even if...
That's good. Feel better soon.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:47.490
Even if...

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:49.100
The principal is a goat.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.810
The school statue is also a goat.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.980
Even the composers in the
music room are goats.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:53.230
Baa
Beh

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:53.410
Even the school song is in Goat.
Baa
Beh

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:54.690
Beh, beh, beh, beh...
Even the school song is in Goat.
Baa
Beh

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:55.940
Baa
Beh

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:56.350
Beh, beh, beh, beh...

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.590
Beh
Baa
Beh, beh, beh, beh...

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:59.650
Baa, baa, baa, baa...
Baa
Beh

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:00.660
Baa, baa, baa, baa...

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:01.700
Kei-kun, that's Sheep.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:02.970
Baa, baa, baa, ba—

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:03.810
Sheep!

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:04.650
Yep. Sheep.

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:08.130
This is beyond my ability to adapt!

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:14.830
"Cuticle Life: The Idiot Sons, 13 Years Ago"

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:17.060
Shut up already.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.430
The parent should shut him up.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:19.930
Go home, brat!

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:21.470
Shut up!

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:24.760
What's wrong, Haruka?
You don't want to see the blossoms?

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.330
It couldn't be... That's impossible.

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:29.310
He's way too young to have
awakened to his powers.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:34.580
We're going to make a run for it.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:35.390
Who are you?!

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:37.270
And where are we going?!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.370
Some place where there
aren't any people.

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:48.030
Human ears can't really
hear unnecessary things.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.580
If you think about something else,

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.240
the unnecessary sounds
won't bug you as much.

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:55.090
Am I really that white and disturbing?

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:59.320
Yeah. You're disturbingly
cute and you smell good.

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.550
Hey, Mister.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.040
Why do I hear two different
voices from you?

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.130
It's a secret.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.800
Hey, your brother's back.

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.230
Did Haruka fall asleep?

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:19.690
Yeah. If he doesn't wake up,
I'll carry him home for you.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:20.080
Unsweetened Black

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:20.900
Here.
Unsweetened Black

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:23.100
I told you that you
could keep the change.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:24.590
Instead you bought one for me?

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.690
You're a good kid.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.070
You're a good guy, too, Mister.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:32.250
I sort of want to give
you a thank-you letter.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:36.080
I used to be a super hero,

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:38.750
so I just have to help those who need it.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.510
Is anyone bullying you?

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.560
If anyone is giving you
a hard time, I'll help you out.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:46.170
Nah, I'm fine.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:48.420
Everyone's really nice.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.000
I see. That's good, then.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.080
Are you not a super
hero anymore, mister?

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:01.360
Well, a super hero is
a lonely soldier.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:04.060
So, now I'm in a villainous group,
and I have lots of friends.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.570
You're a bad guy?!

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:08.390
Yup. I was supposed to
do a kidnapping today.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.540
Give Haruka back!

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:11.530
He's really heavy, though.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.080
You don't seem like a bad guy, Mister.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.950
You should be able to get away
by the time I'm an adult.

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.680
Before you get arrested by me.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.590
Like you'd be able to catch me, idiot.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.720
I'll be able to catch you easily, Mister.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.790
Just try it.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:40.990
I wonder if that guy
has been caught...

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:52.320
"Extra: Bar Ragdoll"

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:57.910
Welco—

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:02.390
A goat has
arrived!!

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:03.580
A goat has arrived!
A goat has
arrived!!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.380
That rain is horrible.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.220
Indeed.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.130
And something resembling a person
showed up, too. Thank goodness.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:10.380
Here you go.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:13.340
Thank you.

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.750
Such a well-trained goat.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.980
Yet this bag...

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:21.240
Wipe
Wipe

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:23.120
I'm guessing it's some
old guy inside.
Wipe
Wipe

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:23.440
Wipe
Wipe

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.450
Shall we get some sake
since it's been a while?

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:28.110
I'd like a cocktail, I would.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.280
What will it be?

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:32.150
A martini.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:32.390
The goat
is ordering
the king
of cocktails,
the martini!!

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:35.070
The goat is ordering the king
of cocktails, the martini!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.950
And for you, sir?

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:40.290
Please decide for me, Don.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.450
This guy is hella annoying.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.350
An Angel's Kiss, then.

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:46.670
Don't make such a girly
choice for him, you goat!

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.480
It's been a while since we've
had a drink at a bar.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.580
There are nights when you want
to get drunk, there are.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:53.590
How wonderful.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.240
Nights when a goat wants to get drunk?

00:08:57.330 --> 00:09:00.370
And exactly how is that
bag going to drink this?

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:05.350
It gets tiring being chased by the
police all the time, it does.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.060
Indeed.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.980
Even if a raccoon dog
or a snake appears,

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.370
people call 911, I guess.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.660
I guess goats get reported, too.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:21.040
Here you go. A martini.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.200
The king of cocktails.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.290
A drink befitting a king like me, it is.

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.310
No matter how you look
at it, your fate is

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:30.840
to be eaten by the king of the beasts...

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.050
The edge is a bit mediocre, it is.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.550
Looks like you stirred it too long.

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:47.510
You've got great form,
so that's rather unfortunate.

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:51.350
I just got

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:53.770
criticized by a goat.

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:01.330
What's wrong, Iori-san?

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:06.150
This is my roommate,
the bartender, Hamada Iori.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.110
Apparently, he is trying to
go from second rate

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:10.620
to first rate because of a goat.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:12.360
One more time.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.180
"Cuticle Life: The Idiot Sons, 10 Years Ago"

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:17.650
Chestnut... sawtooth
oak... white birch...

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:18.680
"Cuticle Life: The Idiot Sons, 10 Years Ago"

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.090
Oak.

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.550
Yataro, what's the soup today?

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:23.790
Pumpkin.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:29.650
You're correct.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:33.690
If you have a sensitive nose,
you'll have no problems.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:36.250
You're surrounded by
nature and great food.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.400
If you concentrate on
your sense of smell,

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.370
you'll awaken to your power
whether you want to or not.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.310
Your problem is...

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:45.950
You're a bit slow.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:47.910
I'm sorry.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.520
See? You're making that
pitiful face again.

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:51.920
Sharpen

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.640
All right, much better.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:57.990
Always use both hands.

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.390
Hmm, not good.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.470
I guess it's harder with only one eye.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.080
I'm sorry.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.430
You don't need to apologize.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:12.040
It doesn't matter if your parent is
a traitor or a ruthless criminal.

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:15.940
You don't have any future
plans to betray me, do you?

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.110
Not at all!

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:20.760
It was your dad who did this
to my right eye, not you.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:21.610
Don't worry about it.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:26.540
But in a way, I guess I'm making
you take responsibility for it.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:28.360
Guess I'm not very convincing.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.560
That's not true!

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:32.150
The only reason I'm able
to be here is because

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.650
Soumei-san picked me as the next vessel.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.590
I don't know what would
have happened to me if

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.100
Soumei-san didn't push away
everyone's objections.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:38.250
Not to mention,
I'm still inexperienced and

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:39.380
haven't awakened to my ability yet

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:41.930
so normally I wouldn't have even
been considered for his vessel.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:43.710
And yet, he's personally training me,
so there's no amount

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:45.300
of thanks that would be enough.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.570
Flustered
...is how I'm feeling.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:48.430
What am I going to do?
How can I tell him how I feel?
Flustered

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:48.640
Flustered

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:50.350
I already got the message...
Flustered

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:50.640
Flustered

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:51.720
Crying

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:52.540
Yata! Yataro! How about a letter?

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:56.140
What am I going to do?

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:58.430
Oh, stop crying already!
What am I going to do?

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.660
What am I going to do?

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:10.040
The current boss of the
Kujou group, Baba Toukichi.

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.270
I'd like you to get rid of him for me.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:18.470
The current Japanese mafia has to
actually outsource its hits?

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:19.430
Why you...

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:21.470
Oh, stop it, Gabriella.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:24.090
What do you want to do, Don?

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:35.710
All right.

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:38.610
We shall accept this job, we shall.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:41.480
Kujou Group Boss
Assassination Case
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:45.280
Meeting Room

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:51.650
To think, yakuza asking the mafia to
take out another yakuza group...

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:55.460
At least it's good that we will do
anything if the money is right.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:56.470
Lorenzo.

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:57.480
Yes?

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:03.060
Are there no samurais
in this country anymore?

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:11.230
Long, straight, black hair.

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:12.890
Truly beautiful hair.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.350
Conditioned to the tips.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:18.860
The young head of the Kujou
group, Kurami Torayasu.

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:20.870
How the hell does he know
about the young maste—

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:23.530
Wait, Tetsu. Let him do as he wants.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.850
If you didn't have such nice hair,

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:27.610
I'd immediately throw you
out for being yakuza.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.670
You can find out anything
just with hair.

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:31.740
Are the rumors true?

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:33.560
Don't believe me?

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.410
I could tell you even
more, if you'd like.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:40.510
For example, the boss is currently in
the hospital awaiting difficult surgery.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:45.120
How troublesome.
That was supposed to be a secret.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.410
Only my uncle and I know about that.

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:48.950
Seems so.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.850
I also know exactly why
you've come here.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.620
This should be fast then.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.810
I want to know all the
information you have

00:13:56.210 --> 00:14:00.090
on the mafia that is after the
boss's life, the Valentino Family.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.940
He isn't human.
You shouldn't get involved.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.610
There are a lot of demons and
dragons in this world.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:11.540
I'm also a tiger...

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:12.380
That's not what I mean.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:14.360
He's a real...

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:15.690
goat.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.160
A goat?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.570
It doesn't look like you're kidding.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:24.330
Are you referring to the
goat that eats paper

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:25.530
and goes baa baa?

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:28.890
That's indeed the goat,
but this goat doesn't eat paper.

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.090
It's a dirty goat that eats money.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.770
Tetsu, tell the boys to find a goat.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:36.560
Peek.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:37.120
Where is it?
Peek.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:42.290
More importantly,
forget about the goat,

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:44.230
and concentrate on the surgery.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:51.740
She's indeed a genius and isn't
completely loyal to the goat,

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:55.310
but the one performing the
surgery on the boss, Noah,

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.720
is one of the leaders
of the Valentino Family.

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:02.210
This is problematic, it is.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.620
One promised to kill him,

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:07.420
and the other promised
to save his life.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.910
I'll just kill him after Noah's surgery!

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.080
Like hell.

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.640
Why would I even perform
the surgery, then?

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.870
It'll be impossible to do both.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:19.180
Noah, this is all because you
acted on your own, it is.

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.210
Tell us where the boss is, you will.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:25.430
I'm just here to do my job.

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:26.610
Noah, why you...

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.020
Stop being difficult!

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.360
What? You wanna go?

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.870
What good will come out of
us fighting each other?

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:36.920
Either our assassination
or Noah's surgery,

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:42.060
whichever comes first will be
the winner in this argument.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.800
So, that's what's happening.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:49.850
Why you... Stop messing around!

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.510
Silence, underling.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:52.390
What?!

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:53.500
Tetsu, stop.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.570
If you're able to complete
the surgery first,

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:57.040
they won't go through
with the hit on him.

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.260
Can we trust that agreement?

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:03.310
Are you underestimating
the Don, Young Master?

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:06.770
A promise within the
family is absolute.

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:11.000
If the Don says it's done, it's done.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:17.410
Oh, Yuuta? How did visiting
Kei in the hospital go?

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:18.770
Was he alive?

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:22.370
Yes. He was still breathing slightly,
so I made sure to stop it.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:23.920
Yuuta-kun, that's a no-no.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:26.170
Influenza's going around right now,

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:28.630
so make sure you gargle and
wash your hands, Yuuta.

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:30.990
It won't be funny if you're both out.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:34.340
What, me? Yeah, I am.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.430
I'm actually doing that right now.

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:39.010
Yeah, I just got ho—

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:40.950
The goat!

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.270
Hey, pervy wolf.

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:46.520
Be happy. We have a job for you.

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:51.110
This is Noah's hair.
Be sure to get a good taste.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.700
Where is Noah?

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:53.950
Why you...

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.990
I'm asking you, where
the hell is Noah?!

00:16:58.990 --> 00:16:59.320
Sasaki
Yuuta

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.350
Sensei! What's wrong, Sensei?!

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.480
That's hot, damn it! Stop it!

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:05.330
You will tell us now, you will.

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:06.250
Potato Starch

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:10.990
Or we'll be adding potato
starch to that water,

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:13.230
to make it thick.
Potato Starch

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.550
No! Anything but that!
Potato Starch

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.160
No! Anything but that!

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:19.220
As you know, Gabriella is rather
short-tempered, she is.

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:22.190
I, myself, was shot
seven times just waiting

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.680
for you to come home.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.630
Tell us, Wolf.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.770
You value your life, do you not?

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:39.580
Sensei!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:42.580
General Hospital

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.170
Hello?

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:44.970
Run!

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:46.940
The goat is on its way!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:48.800
They know where you are.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.050
I was forced into telling them.
I'm sorry.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:52.050
Hurry and lea—

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.200
Mr. Detective,

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:56.720
That's impossible.
The surgery has already begun.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.680
Do you intend to start a
war over a dying man?

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.420
Give up on the boss!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.180
Call
Inaba Hiroshi

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:06.550
I have this life because of my father.

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:08.790
I'd be more than happy
to give it up for his sake.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:09.840
Wha... Hey!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.590
Tetsu. How many guys could
you gather right now?

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:16.180
Well...

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:19.980
Most of them are at farms
or zoos right now.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:21.590
Why?

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.410
To look for goats...

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:32.050
I should have listened
to the detective.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.650
There are far fewer guarding
the place than I expected.

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.140
At this rate, there won't
be much for us to do, Don.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.720
This will be too quick, it will.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.190
Lorenzo!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:50.730
Now, Tetsu!

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:55.900
Don't underestimate us,
you third-rate!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:18:59.390
What?!

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:02.330
Looking away could cost you your life!

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.660
My, you gave me quite the scare there.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.370
It looks like you're
somewhat capable, it does.

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:17.620
The world's bigger than I thought...

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.260
To think, guys like you existed...

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:23.070
We're totally on a different level.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:28.680
You now know the difference
in ability, you do.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.550
You will open up the path, you will.

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:36.990
Hey now, the boss's
life is on the line.

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:40.110
I won't let you through
even on my life!

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:41.860
You fool!

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:48.100
Don!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:52.730
For some reason, I thought
I could do it today, I did.

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:54.850
Somehow, I felt that way, too, Don.

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:56.380
What? You guys, too?

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.630
How dare you do that to the Don?!

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:02.260
Dad...

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:04.090
Addio.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.430
Sorry, Dad.

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:11.220
Looks like this is the end for me...

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.910
Wait, you shall, Gabriella!

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:24.900
Don! Why'd you get in the way?

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.660
It is finished, it is.

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:30.640
I've won, Sis.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:35.500
Young one, you were able
to protect the boss.

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.750
Why'd you defend me?

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:43.970
You are equal to a leader
in my family, you are.

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:44.460
If I were to lose one of them,
I'd be done for, I would.

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.770
Damn it! I was so close!

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.110
Why you little brat!
If I were to lose one of them,
I'd be done for, I would.

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:49.230
Why you little brat!

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:51.560
Family is great, it is.

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:05.530
That was rather mean of you
to call the police, Mr. Detective.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:06.740
Where's the goat?

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.990
I'm the only one left here.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:12.720
I figured you'd show up, so I waited.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:16.210
He was a total goat.

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:18.710
I told you. He's totally a goat.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:23.170
I can see why that goat is able
to gather people around him.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.490
Um... can't say that
I understand that.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.890
Uh, what do you mean?

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:32.280
It'd be hard to put into words,

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:38.440
but it could be that big, deep,
and passionate goat...

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:42.130
is the last samurai.

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:45.400
The End

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:48.240
And that's what happened.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.910
It was really rough!

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.290
Don't worry, I'll peel
your apple for you.

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:56.040
I can't even catch a cold in peace?!

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:30.090
Hey, I didn't hear anything about
them being tied up, producer.

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:33.160
I apologize, but this show
is rather popular right now.

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:34.430
But we should go full force with this kind of thi—

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:37.920
Shut up! How much care do you
think I put in raising her?!

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:38.980
You should say something, too!

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:41.230
I've grown so big.
